WEBVTT

00:00.780 --> 00:04.750
Hapa tuna mlingano mrefu sana.

00:04.750 --> 00:09.375
Na nataka kuona kama utaweza kurahisisha hii.

00:09.375 --> 00:11.000
Nitakupa muda mchache ufanye hii.

00:13.680 --> 00:17.480
Kwa hiyo hii inachanganya zaidi kuliko zile zilizopita.

00:17.480 --> 00:20.960
Tuna y na xy, na x kipeo cha pili

00:20.960 --> 00:25.730
na x, kisha xy na y kipeo cha pili zimejirudia.

00:25.730 --> 00:28.370
Na kuna majaribu, kwa sababu unaona y hapa

00:28.370 --> 00:29.940
na y hapa, ambapo unaweza

00:29.940 --> 00:32.549
kujumlisha hii hasi 3y jumlisha 4xy

00:32.549 --> 00:34.830
kwa sababu kuna y na y.

00:34.830 --> 00:37.360
Lakini kitu muhimu cha kukumbuka hapa

00:37.360 --> 00:40.380
ni kuwa y ni tofauti na xy.

00:40.380 --> 00:41.810
Fikiria kama zingekuwa namba.

00:41.810 --> 00:46.672
Kama y ingekuwa 3 na x ingekuwa 2, kisha y ingekuwa ni 3

00:46.672 --> 00:49.270
wakati xy ingekuwa ni 6.

00:49.270 --> 00:52.010
Na y ni tofauti na y kipeo cha pili.

00:52.010 --> 00:54.710
Kwa mara nyingine tena, kama y ingekuwa na thamani ya 3, kisha

00:54.710 --> 00:57.270
y kipeo cha pili ingekuwa 9.

00:57.270 --> 00:59.580
Hivyo hata kama unaona herufi sawa hapa,

00:59.580 --> 01:03.640
lakini hazina thamani sawa-- nadhani huwezi kujumlisha hizi mbili

01:03.640 --> 01:05.480
au kutoa hii mitajo.

01:05.480 --> 01:07.610
y ni tofauti na y kipeo cha pili,

01:07.610 --> 01:09.860
na pia ni tofauti na xy.

01:09.860 --> 01:12.640
Sasa kwa namna hiyo, hebu tuone kama kuna kitu tunaweza

01:12.640 --> 01:14.480
kurahisisha.

01:14.480 --> 01:16.700
Hivyo kwanza, hebu tuone kuhusu mtajo y.

01:16.700 --> 01:18.060
Kwa hiyo una hasi 3y huku.

01:18.060 --> 01:20.140
Je tuna y nyingine yeyote?

01:20.140 --> 01:20.710
Ndio, tunayo.

01:20.710 --> 01:22.889
Tuna hii 2y hapa.

01:22.889 --> 01:24.930
Kwa hiyo nitaipanga upya.

01:24.930 --> 01:28.860
Kwa hiyo tuna hasi 3y jumlisha 2y.

01:31.740 --> 01:33.770
Sasa, nitafanya

01:33.770 --> 01:36.380
kiholela, lakini kwa sababu mtajo unaofuata ni xy

01:36.380 --> 01:38.970
tuangalie kama kuna mtajo mwingine wenye xy.

01:38.970 --> 01:41.945
Kwa hiyo tutajumlisha 4xy hapa.

01:41.945 --> 01:43.570
Hebu ngoja niandike hapa-- ninaupanga

01:43.570 --> 01:47.200
upya mlinganyo wote-- jumlisha 4xy.

01:47.200 --> 01:50.990
Na kisha nina toa 4xy hapa.

01:54.710 --> 01:56.550
Na kisha twende kwenye mtajo x kipeo cha pili.

01:56.550 --> 01:59.810
Nina hasi 2 mara x kipeo cha pili, au toa 2x kipeo cha pili.

01:59.810 --> 02:01.830
Hebu tuangalie hii.

02:01.830 --> 02:04.590
Hivyo nina toa 2x kipeo cha pili.

02:04.590 --> 02:06.360
Je nina x kipeo cha pili nyingine?

02:06.360 --> 02:07.080
Ndio, ninayo.

02:07.080 --> 02:09.240
Nina hii 3x kipeo cha pili hapa.

02:09.240 --> 02:12.720
Hivyo jumlisha 3x kipeo cha pili.

02:12.720 --> 02:17.990
Na kisha hebu tuone, nina mtajo x hapa,

02:17.990 --> 02:20.220
na inaonekana iko peke yake.

02:20.220 --> 02:22.390
Hivyo itakuwa jumlisha 2x.

02:22.390 --> 02:24.190
Na kisha nina y kipeo cha pili iliyo peke yake

02:24.190 --> 02:29.320
nitaizungushia duara la njano-- hivyo ni jumlisha y kipeo cha pili.

02:29.320 --> 02:31.880
Kwa hiyo nilichofanya hapa ni kupanga upya huu mlinganyo

02:31.880 --> 02:34.820
na nimeweka rangi kulingana na mtajo.

02:34.820 --> 02:37.160
Na sasa itakuwa rahisi kidogo.

02:37.160 --> 02:38.740
Sasa hebu tufanye.

02:38.740 --> 02:41.580
Kama nina hasi 3 ya kitu fulani

02:41.580 --> 02:43.524
jumlisha 2 ya hicho kitu, nitakuwa na nini?

02:43.524 --> 02:45.690
Au njia nyingine ni kusema, nina 2 ya kitu fulani

02:45.690 --> 02:48.730
na ninatoa 3 ya hicho kitu, nitabakiwa na nini?

02:48.730 --> 02:50.940
Nitabakiwa na hasi 1 ya hicho kitu.

02:50.940 --> 02:55.872
Hivyo ninaweza kuandika hasi 1y, au ninaweza kuandika hasi y.

02:55.872 --> 02:57.580
Na njia nyingine unayoweza kutumia,

02:57.580 --> 02:59.496
lakini napenda kutafakari zaidi,

02:59.496 --> 03:00.960
ni kipi ni kizidishi hapa?

03:00.960 --> 03:02.254
Ni hasi 3.

03:02.254 --> 03:03.420
Ni kipi kizidishi hapa?

03:03.420 --> 03:04.160
Ni 2.

03:04.160 --> 03:05.576
Tunazofanyia kazi--

03:05.576 --> 03:07.440
zote ni mtajo y, na si mtajo xy,

03:07.440 --> 03:09.880
si mtajo y kipeo cha pili, ni y.

03:09.880 --> 03:12.560
Na kwa hiyo hasi 3 jumlisha 2 ni hasi 1,

03:12.560 --> 03:16.000
au hasi 1y ni sawa na hasi y.

03:16.000 --> 03:19.300
Hivyo tumerahisisha kama ilivyo hapa.

03:19.300 --> 03:21.180
Na sasa tuangalie mtajo xy.

03:21.180 --> 03:24.560
Kama nina 4 ya hii, 4 xy na

03:24.560 --> 03:29.060
ninatakiwa kutoa 4 xy, nitabakiwa na xy ngapi?

03:29.060 --> 03:30.890
Sitabakiwa na xy yeyote.

03:30.890 --> 03:33.170
Au unaweza kusema tujumlishe vizidishi,

03:33.170 --> 03:36.740
4 jumlisha hasi 4, utapata 0 xy.

03:36.740 --> 03:39.450
Kwa njia yeyote hizi mbili zitakwisha.

03:39.450 --> 03:41.120
Kama nina 4 ya kitu fulani na nikatoa

03:41.120 --> 03:44.350
hizo 4 ya hicho kitu, sitabakiwa na kitu.

03:44.350 --> 03:46.940
Na hivyo sikubakiwa na xy.

03:46.940 --> 03:48.830
Na kisha hapa

03:48.830 --> 03:51.910
naweza kuandika 0xy, lakini

03:51.910 --> 03:54.420
haina umuhimu-- kwa hiyo hapa

03:54.420 --> 03:56.160
nina mtajo x kipeo cha pili.

03:56.160 --> 03:58.700
Hasi 2 jumlisha 3 ni 1.

03:58.700 --> 04:01.240
Au njia nyingine ni kusema, kama nina 3x kipeo cha pili

04:01.240 --> 04:02.830
na ninatakiwa kutoa 2 ya x kipeo cha pili,

04:02.830 --> 04:05.540
hivyo nitabakiwa na 1x kipeo cha pili.

04:05.540 --> 04:09.140
Kwa hiyo hii hapa tumerahisisha na kuwa 1x kipeo cha pili.

04:09.140 --> 04:10.950
Au unaweza kuandika x kipeo cha pili.

04:10.950 --> 04:13.450
1x kipeo cha pili ni sawa na x kipeo cha pili.

04:13.450 --> 04:16.779
Kwa hiyo jumlisha x kipeo cha pili, na kisha hakuna

04:16.779 --> 04:18.260
kitu cha kurahisisha kilichobaki.

04:18.260 --> 04:23.675
Hivyo jumlisha 2x jumlisha y kipeo cha pili.

04:27.365 --> 04:27.990
Na tumemaliza.

04:27.990 --> 04:29.000
Na wakati mwingine unaweza kupata

04:29.000 --> 04:31.250
jibu katika mpangilio mwingine, lakini

04:31.250 --> 04:33.059
jinsi tulivyoandika hii mitajo si tatizo.

04:33.059 --> 04:35.100
Kitu muhimu ni kuwa umeweza kurahisisha

04:35.100 --> 04:37.535
hii mitajo minne.
